WEBVTT

00:02:29.979 --> 00:02:35.818
And actually there's very little evidence
for the emergence of rigid social classes,

00:02:35.860 --> 00:02:38.529
which is not to say that nothing happened.

00:02:38.946 --> 00:02:40.489
Over those 4,000 years,

00:02:40.531 --> 00:02:44.619
technological change
actually proceeded apace.

00:02:45.119 --> 00:02:46.787
Without kings,

00:02:46.787 --> 00:02:49.582
without bureaucracies,
without standing armies,

00:02:49.624 --> 00:02:55.046
these early farming populations fostered
the development of mathematical knowledge,

00:02:55.087 --> 00:02:56.923
advanced metallurgy.

00:02:56.964 --> 00:03:01.219
They learned to cultivate olives,
vines and date palms.